#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House4/scripts.inc:30
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House4_Text_PeopleSawHighFlyingPokemon"
msgid ""
"People were saying they saw a POKéMON\n"
"flying high above HOENN.\p"
"Is it flying around all the time?\n"
"Doesn't it need to rest somewhere?$"
msgstr ""
"大家都说看到有一只宝可梦\n"
"在丰缘地区的高空中飞翔。\p"
"它一直都在飞吗？\n"
"不需要在什么地方休息吗？$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House4/scripts.inc:36
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House4_Text_SkyPokemon"
msgid ""
"A sky POKéMON!\n"
"A sky POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"天空的宝可梦！\n"
"天空的宝可梦！$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House4/scripts.inc:40
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House4_Text_WhereDidYouComeFrom"
msgid "Where did you come from?$"
msgstr "你是从哪里来的？$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House4/scripts.inc:43
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House4_Text_YesTown"
msgid ""
"Yes?\n"
"YES TOWN?\p"
"I've never heard of a place like that.$"
msgstr ""
"是？\n"
"“是”镇？\p"
"我从来没听说过那种地方。$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House4/scripts.inc:48
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House4_Text_YouHaveToComeFromSomewhere"
msgid ""
"No? That doesn't make any sense.\n"
"You have to come from somewhere.\p"
"Oh! Wait! You're not going to say you\n"
"were born at the bottom of the sea?$"
msgstr ""
"不是？那说不通啊。\n"
"你总得是从哪里来的吧。\p"
"哦！等等！你该不会要说\n"
"你是在海底出生的吧？$"
